WEBVTT

00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:41.330
MFN... Martian First Network.

00:01:43.639 --> 00:01:45.072
Tonight's headline news...

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.574
is the continued
terrorist bombings.

00:01:47.643 --> 00:01:50.237
Hi! I am reporting it.

00:01:50.312 --> 00:01:51.574
My!

00:01:51.647 --> 00:01:55.083
Last night, in the sixth block
of the city of Wells...

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:58.085
there was the third bombing
this month.

00:01:58.153 --> 00:02:01.384
And the way they did it
was just horrible!

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:20.940
Due to the magnetic storm,
all departures are delayed.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:25.913
We apologize
for any inconvenience.

00:02:25.981 --> 00:02:28.882
This has been
MAA information service.

00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:05.118
Police assume that
these "puppet bombs" are...

00:03:05.187 --> 00:03:07.155
done by
the same terrorist...

00:03:07.222 --> 00:03:09.156
that is responsible
for recent activities.

00:03:09.224 --> 00:03:11.658
Janet, I hope you won't
blow up.

00:03:11.727 --> 00:03:15.663
Well, if I do,
I'll give you an exclusive.

00:03:15.731 --> 00:03:18.495
Touché.

00:03:22.972 --> 00:03:24.439
You said we can reproduce?

00:03:24.506 --> 00:03:25.438
Right.

00:03:25.507 --> 00:03:30.604
That's the secret
of the Third types.

00:03:30.679 --> 00:03:35.582
You can step beyond the bounds
of conventional robots.

00:03:38.787 --> 00:03:42.120
Now I can see why.

00:03:43.525 --> 00:03:46.153
But, Julian, what's your role?

00:03:46.228 --> 00:03:48.696
The serial number
of the CPU shows that...

00:03:48.764 --> 00:03:51.358
I am the final model
off the line.

00:03:51.433 --> 00:03:53.867
I still can't figure out...

00:03:53.936 --> 00:03:57.167
why they made me a male kid.

00:03:59.775 --> 00:04:02.005
I am female.

00:04:02.077 --> 00:04:05.706
Now I understand why
the murdered Thirds were...

00:04:05.781 --> 00:04:08.716
so human,
like a writer or singer.

00:04:08.784 --> 00:04:12.220
They wanted the robots
who can reproduce to be...

00:04:12.287 --> 00:04:15.256
emotionally perfect...

00:04:16.358 --> 00:04:21.227
because their babies
will be humans.

00:04:21.296 --> 00:04:23.696
What the hell is so funny?

00:04:25.801 --> 00:04:27.860
What's the matter?

00:04:27.936 --> 00:04:29.995
Maternal clock ticking?

00:04:30.072 --> 00:04:33.974
Maybe you'd like Detective Ross
to set your alarm.

00:04:40.983 --> 00:04:44.248
Why did they make such robots?

00:04:44.319 --> 00:04:45.911
Who knows.

00:04:45.988 --> 00:04:48.252
But I'll bet Asakura does.

00:04:48.323 --> 00:04:51.224
Or... D'anclaude.

00:04:51.293 --> 00:04:53.693
He must have been
a part of this.

00:05:02.971 --> 00:05:06.907
Christ, another bombing.
That makes 5 this month.

00:05:06.975 --> 00:05:08.169
Yeah.

00:05:08.243 --> 00:05:11.940
So, I guess we'll get stuck
with the investigation.

00:05:12.014 --> 00:05:13.777
Yeah.

00:05:13.849 --> 00:05:17.444
Well, it's a crappy deal,
if you ask me.

00:05:17.519 --> 00:05:22.479
That means we got to drop
the Third case, right?

00:05:22.558 --> 00:05:23.855
Yeah.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:27.419
Are you listening?
- Yeah.

00:05:27.496 --> 00:05:30.624
Did you make a full recovery?

00:05:30.699 --> 00:05:32.132
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:32.201 --> 00:05:34.362
These new body parts
take some getting used to.

00:05:34.436 --> 00:05:36.028
Ironic, isn't it?

00:05:36.105 --> 00:05:37.538
Little by little...

00:05:37.606 --> 00:05:41.303
you're becoming like
the robots you hate.

00:05:41.376 --> 00:05:43.970
Let's get down to business.
Why the new orders?

00:05:44.046 --> 00:05:46.571
The bombings don't need
a full-time investigation.

00:05:46.648 --> 00:05:49.082
Maybe they do.

00:05:49.151 --> 00:05:52.018
Some people
think it's justified.

00:05:52.087 --> 00:05:54.248
Politics, isn't it?

00:05:54.323 --> 00:05:55.756
This is an order.

00:05:55.824 --> 00:05:59.260
Do what I tell you to do,
Ross Sylibus.

00:05:59.328 --> 00:06:03.196
You have to work on
the indiscriminate bombing case.

00:06:03.265 --> 00:06:08.498
Are you telling me to forget
what they did to me?

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.334
The terrorist D'anclaude
has been...

00:06:11.406 --> 00:06:14.842
in Shinora
Government Hospital.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.676
I can't accept the contradictory
report that you filed.

00:06:18.747 --> 00:06:19.839
But, Sir...

00:06:19.915 --> 00:06:24.284
If you don't believe me,
go and see for yourself.

00:06:24.353 --> 00:06:27.288
You've got that?

00:06:31.927 --> 00:06:34.191
Ironic, isn't it?

00:06:34.263 --> 00:06:35.696
Little by little...

00:06:35.764 --> 00:06:38.392
you're becoming like
the robots you hate.

00:06:55.951 --> 00:07:00.718
Oh, yes, the terrorist
is still in ICU.

00:07:00.789 --> 00:07:02.723
You can't see him yet.

00:07:02.791 --> 00:07:04.884
What's his condition like?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.894
We've been sending you updates.

00:07:06.962 --> 00:07:08.691
Yes, but I'd like to know more.

00:07:08.764 --> 00:07:10.197
I'm sorry, but...

00:07:10.265 --> 00:07:14.395
this is all we can do
for the Police Department.

00:07:14.469 --> 00:07:17.404
The hospital is controlled
by the government, you know.

00:07:17.472 --> 00:07:19.872
Excuse me.
I have someone waiting for me.

00:07:23.212 --> 00:07:25.908
You've got an impressive
security system.

00:07:25.981 --> 00:07:29.178
It's self-defense
against terrorists.

00:07:31.653 --> 00:07:33.985
Security guards are old news.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.960
The vice president!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:59.713
That's where all my memory
was backed up and stored.

00:07:59.781 --> 00:08:01.942
Even if they
do kill all of us...

00:08:02.017 --> 00:08:03.416
Will you give it a rest!

00:08:16.531 --> 00:08:17.691
Bingo!

00:08:19.034 --> 00:08:20.626
Warning.

00:08:20.702 --> 00:08:22.397
Only authorized personnel...

00:08:22.471 --> 00:08:24.336
are permitted within
the memory bank l/O room.

00:08:24.406 --> 00:08:25.964
Shit!

00:08:26.041 --> 00:08:28.134
Please vacate immediately.

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:31.805
Sorry. We're lost.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.314
You must vacate
within 10 seconds...

00:08:34.383 --> 00:08:36.544
otherwise...

00:08:41.156 --> 00:08:44.023
I want to ask Asakura...

00:08:44.092 --> 00:08:46.026
why he created a robot...

00:08:46.094 --> 00:08:48.995
who could
kick ass and raise kids.

00:08:49.064 --> 00:08:51.999
He designed you, too.

00:08:52.067 --> 00:08:54.535
I can't get pregnant.

00:09:01.243 --> 00:09:03.040
That's it.

00:09:14.589 --> 00:09:17.888
I hate that this
is the easiest way.

00:09:22.364 --> 00:09:23.991
Hey, hurry up!

00:09:24.066 --> 00:09:27.263
Look, I'm doing this
for you, Armitage!

00:09:28.303 --> 00:09:30.533
I need to know about me.

00:09:30.605 --> 00:09:32.300
Who am I and why.

00:09:34.743 --> 00:09:36.768
I'll go and check.

00:09:40.115 --> 00:09:42.743
I'm searching
for Asakura's file.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.247
Armitage...

00:09:47.322 --> 00:09:51.486
open my virtual monitor
from my navigational system.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:52.891
O.K.

00:09:57.032 --> 00:09:59.466
I've located
the still image file.

00:09:59.534 --> 00:10:01.297
I'm defrosting it now.

00:10:13.482 --> 00:10:14.813
D'anclaude.

00:10:19.221 --> 00:10:20.153
Sylibus here.

00:10:20.222 --> 00:10:21.655
Where the hell are you?

00:10:21.723 --> 00:10:23.350
The lieutenant's
been looking for you.

00:10:23.425 --> 00:10:24.858
As you can
see in the monitor...

00:10:24.926 --> 00:10:25.858
I'm snooping for information.

00:10:25.927 --> 00:10:27.360
On the old case?

00:10:27.429 --> 00:10:31.092
I think the reception's
breaking up. Later. Bye.

00:10:31.166 --> 00:10:34.067
Wait! I've got
some hot news for you.

00:10:34.136 --> 00:10:38.436
They found the board
from a puppet bomb.

00:10:38.507 --> 00:10:40.566
Looked identical
to a board for Thirds.

00:10:43.912 --> 00:10:45.345
Why?

00:10:45.414 --> 00:10:48.815
Why is my daddy standing
there with D'anclaude?

00:10:51.186 --> 00:10:52.380
Julian!

00:10:52.454 --> 00:10:56.447
Damn it!
I think someone's discovered me.

00:10:56.525 --> 00:10:57.856
Log out now!

00:11:01.696 --> 00:11:03.163
Hey!

00:11:03.231 --> 00:11:06.667
Oh, God!
Something's controlling me!

00:11:09.237 --> 00:11:10.204
Please help me!

00:11:18.713 --> 00:11:21.375
Naomi Armitage.

00:11:22.584 --> 00:11:25.018
It's no use searching
for more information.

00:11:25.087 --> 00:11:28.386
You can't stop the Third types
from being killed.

00:11:38.733 --> 00:11:42.294
Shoot me. I don't mind.

00:11:57.252 --> 00:12:00.119
Who are you? Get out!

00:12:01.256 --> 00:12:03.622
Quite a setup you got here.

00:12:03.692 --> 00:12:07.856
I bet you've got
illegal applications here...

00:12:07.929 --> 00:12:10.363
instead of educational ones.

00:12:10.432 --> 00:12:12.059
Who the hell do you think I am?

00:12:12.134 --> 00:12:15.297
I don't deal with cop trash...

00:12:17.806 --> 00:12:22.209
I left my badge at home,
so I'm off-duty.

00:12:22.277 --> 00:12:23.710
Now you say so.

00:12:23.778 --> 00:12:25.712
What are you doing at Shinora?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.714
Who the hell's in ICU?

00:12:27.782 --> 00:12:28.874
D'anclaude.

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.713
Don't fuck with me,
you asshole!

00:12:30.785 --> 00:12:32.719
That crazy bastard's out there
and tried to kill me.

00:12:32.787 --> 00:12:35.722
No! It's really him.
He's Dr. Rene D'anclaude...

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.724
originator
of the assassinroid.

00:12:37.792 --> 00:12:39.555
No way!

00:12:39.628 --> 00:12:41.562
What do you mean?

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.723
Then that D'anclaude was...

00:12:43.798 --> 00:12:45.732
Of course, he's a robot...

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:49.327
that was based on character data
of Dr. D'anclaude.

00:12:51.806 --> 00:12:54.400
Pull the trigger.
I dare you.

00:12:56.278 --> 00:12:58.542
You're not a man.

00:12:58.613 --> 00:12:59.910
Are you a Third type?

00:12:59.981 --> 00:13:01.414
Of course not.

00:13:01.483 --> 00:13:05.385
You won't find my name
on the list of failures.

00:13:05.453 --> 00:13:07.887
Us, failures?
- You make me retch!

00:13:07.956 --> 00:13:09.890
Cheap imitations
pretending to be human.

00:13:09.958 --> 00:13:12.586
There's no comparison
to our superiority.

00:13:12.661 --> 00:13:16.256
I couldn't agree more
with humans on one thing.

00:13:16.331 --> 00:13:20.233
All Thirds
should be annihilated.

00:13:24.573 --> 00:13:26.131
I'll kill you!

00:13:46.861 --> 00:13:48.488
Julian!

00:13:48.563 --> 00:13:50.793
I got it.

00:13:50.865 --> 00:13:52.890
That bastard's not the original.

00:13:52.968 --> 00:13:54.799
Don't talk.

00:13:54.869 --> 00:13:56.496
Julian!

00:13:56.571 --> 00:13:59.904
Get away!
You'll be infected!

00:13:59.975 --> 00:14:01.533
Don't touch me!

00:14:08.984 --> 00:14:11.214
Talk!

00:14:11.286 --> 00:14:13.277
Tell me about
the assassinroid, now!

00:14:24.266 --> 00:14:25.790
Stay there.

00:14:25.867 --> 00:14:28.836
Don't come closer.

00:14:48.823 --> 00:14:50.017
Sylibus.

00:14:51.926 --> 00:14:53.450
It must be broken.

00:14:53.528 --> 00:14:55.155
Ross...

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.959
Help!

00:14:59.401 --> 00:15:00.868
Armitage?

00:15:07.942 --> 00:15:11.673
So, one of my men got
a little carried away, Mr...

00:15:11.746 --> 00:15:14.715
I'm Jusup,
Judicial Vice Minister.

00:15:14.783 --> 00:15:17.650
As a representative of
the Legal Affairs Bureau...

00:15:17.719 --> 00:15:22.122
I need an accurate picture
of the MPD's operations.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.750
I'm just a bit confused.

00:15:24.826 --> 00:15:27.886
Why an inspector
from Earth's government...

00:15:27.962 --> 00:15:30.328
has come here.

00:15:30.398 --> 00:15:34.391
I'm simply an observer
for Mr. Jusup.

00:15:34.469 --> 00:15:37.267
Don't mind me and
continue your discussion.

00:15:37.339 --> 00:15:38.897
Hmm.

00:15:40.475 --> 00:15:43.410
Since you're
observing robots here...

00:15:43.478 --> 00:15:47.209
you've noticed that Mars
isn't a feminist society.

00:15:47.282 --> 00:15:49.750
Very well.
You understand us.

00:15:49.818 --> 00:15:53.185
Let's call it a day,
Mr., uh, Randolph.

00:15:53.254 --> 00:15:55.916
How about lunch?

00:16:44.739 --> 00:16:47.572
I'm sick of
the whole damn system.

00:16:52.714 --> 00:16:54.079
Armitage...

00:16:56.384 --> 00:17:00.377
did Julian say he had his memory
backed up and stored?

00:17:00.455 --> 00:17:01.979
Backed up?

00:17:02.056 --> 00:17:03.455
Right.

00:17:03.525 --> 00:17:05.459
If we can get
access to his data...

00:17:05.527 --> 00:17:06.926
we could still bring him back.

00:17:06.995 --> 00:17:08.155
Get it?

00:17:10.565 --> 00:17:12.692
He's not dead.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.247
I am going to see him, then.

00:17:29.317 --> 00:17:33.447
Maybe he's got some information.

00:17:35.089 --> 00:17:37.717
Ross...

00:17:37.792 --> 00:17:40.260
come with me.

00:17:56.945 --> 00:17:59.778
The lieutenant was right.

00:17:59.848 --> 00:18:02.373
I'm becoming a robot.

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.539
Ross.

00:18:53.167 --> 00:18:54.600
Where are we?

00:18:54.669 --> 00:18:56.330
We're inside the program.

00:19:12.287 --> 00:19:15.381
Hi. You came
with your big brother.

00:19:15.456 --> 00:19:16.821
Julian!

00:19:24.699 --> 00:19:27.293
I'm glad to see you again.

00:19:27.368 --> 00:19:28.960
Everyone is here.

00:19:31.906 --> 00:19:35.069
The murdered Thirds.

00:19:40.081 --> 00:19:44.450
Everyone is here.
All of them are my sisters.

00:19:44.519 --> 00:19:46.453
Sadly, they
lack sufficient data...

00:19:46.521 --> 00:19:49.012
to enable them to talk.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:52.218
I'm sorry.
I feel so helpless.

00:19:52.293 --> 00:19:54.227
Hey, it's not so bad.

00:19:54.295 --> 00:19:56.695
You can learn a lot in here.

00:19:56.764 --> 00:19:59.232
For instance, I've got
the lowdown on D'anclaude now.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.131
You mean
Dr. Rene D'anclaude?

00:20:01.202 --> 00:20:05.662
Yes. He and Asakura
developed the Third types.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.334
Then, do you know
where they are now?

00:20:08.409 --> 00:20:12.846
Well, Asakura's files
have been completely erased.

00:20:12.914 --> 00:20:15.382
But I know
where Dr. D'anclaude is.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.145
That must be...

00:20:17.218 --> 00:20:19.686
Right, Shinora.

00:20:20.722 --> 00:20:22.519
You should go now.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.524
If you stay too long...

00:20:24.592 --> 00:20:26.583
you might not
get back to your body.

00:20:26.661 --> 00:20:28.788
I'll return. I promise.

00:20:28.863 --> 00:20:31.559
Please. I'll be waiting.

00:20:39.007 --> 00:20:39.939
What's up?

00:20:40.008 --> 00:20:41.441
Internal troops are active.

00:20:41.509 --> 00:20:42.942
Are we at war?

00:20:43.011 --> 00:20:44.205
No. They're guarding.

00:20:44.278 --> 00:20:45.404
What, the President?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.209
No, Shinora Hospital.

00:20:47.281 --> 00:20:48.771
Shinora?

00:20:56.524 --> 00:20:59.118
They've got as many as
10 tanks, all in front.

00:20:59.193 --> 00:21:01.024
Are they gonna
start a war or what?

00:21:01.095 --> 00:21:02.528
Hold on a minute.

00:21:02.597 --> 00:21:03.723
I'm picking up something.

00:21:03.798 --> 00:21:05.857
What is it?

00:21:05.933 --> 00:21:07.594
A car?

00:21:17.512 --> 00:21:18.911
Holy shit!

00:21:31.626 --> 00:21:33.423
It's them!

00:21:34.696 --> 00:21:36.095
Fire!

00:22:28.116 --> 00:22:29.515
Here.

00:22:42.396 --> 00:22:44.330
It's him.

00:22:44.398 --> 00:22:46.730
D'anclaude.

00:22:46.801 --> 00:22:49.565
Or I should say
Dr. Rene D'anclaude.

00:22:58.079 --> 00:22:59.706
You must be...

00:22:59.781 --> 00:23:02.841
Asakura's daughter...

00:23:02.917 --> 00:23:05.044
the failure.

00:23:07.955 --> 00:23:10.583
We gotta hurry! Come on!

00:23:10.658 --> 00:23:13.559
Let's go,
while we still can.

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:16.927
What's wrong?

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:23.702
Something's coming.

00:23:23.771 --> 00:23:25.830
What is it?

00:23:36.818 --> 00:23:38.683
What the...

00:23:38.753 --> 00:23:41.187
That's one ugly picture.

00:23:43.124 --> 00:23:44.887
I've been waiting for you!

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:54.200
Bastard!

00:23:58.973 --> 00:24:00.440
Ross, hurry up!

00:24:04.378 --> 00:24:06.903
Hey, don't run off!

00:24:06.981 --> 00:24:09.040
I wanna play.

00:24:17.458 --> 00:24:19.892
Come on! Wait!

00:24:21.495 --> 00:24:24.931
There's no way that goddamn
gargoyle is a Third type!

00:24:24.999 --> 00:24:28.298
Hmm. My, look who's talking.

00:24:28.369 --> 00:24:30.303
You guys are brother and sister
of the prototypes...

00:24:30.371 --> 00:24:33.238
that are operated
by the same CPU.

00:24:33.307 --> 00:24:36.242
Did you really
think you were a Third?

00:24:36.310 --> 00:24:37.709
Liar!

00:24:37.778 --> 00:24:39.211
It's true.

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:43.114
Ask Asakura in the dome
on Danich Hill.

00:24:45.753 --> 00:24:47.516
Hey, Armitage!

00:24:49.023 --> 00:24:51.992
What the hell are you gonna do?

00:24:55.696 --> 00:24:57.630
You want a showdown?

00:24:57.698 --> 00:25:00.462
Come on, die together.

00:25:00.534 --> 00:25:03.469
They told me Thirds
shouldn't exist on Mars.

00:25:03.537 --> 00:25:06.768
We have to obey orders.

00:25:06.841 --> 00:25:09.241
I'll exterminate you, bastard!

00:25:09.310 --> 00:25:10.937
Armitage!

00:25:21.389 --> 00:25:23.721
Armitage!

00:27:39.693 --> 00:27:42.890
We can no longer
return to the city.

00:27:44.498 --> 00:27:46.693
Are they really
trying to erase us all?

